<Section id="how-its-made" num="07" title="How it’s being built" tiled>
  <p class="prose">
    mandarinmaxxing is still being built, one version at a time. The words of each level were grouped by hand into
    situations and checked by script so none is missing. Each new version is tested on simulated lessons before it
    goes out, to catch lessons that use words you haven’t met or forget the older ones. It’s far from finished: what
    really shapes it is people studying with it and saying what felt off. Everything, tests included, is
    <a href={`${SKILL_REPO}#how-its-made`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">on GitHub ↗</a>.
  </p>
</Section>
